      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Bir gece r\xFCyanda kendini dev oyuncaklar\u0131n aras\u0131nda buldun.
    Uyurgezer gibi kollar\u0131n \xF6nde y\xFCr\xFCyorsun!\nUyanmak i\xE7in <b>60
    saniye</b> i\xE7inde <b>10 topu</b> yuvalar\u0131na yuvarlamal\u0131s\u0131n.\n\n<b>W
    A S D / Y\xF6n Tu\u015Flar\u0131:</b>  Y\xFCr\xFC\n<b>Toplar\u0131 it:</b>  Topa
    do\u011Fru y\xFCr\xFC, kollar\u0131nla iterek bayrakl\u0131 yuvalara d\xFC\u015F\xFCr\n<b>Kovalayan
    k\xFCpler:</b>  Yakla\u015F\u0131nca seni kovalar, \xE7arparsa geri itilirsin\n<b>ESC
    / P:</b>  Duraklat\n\nSaat \xE7almadan b\xFCt\xFCn toplar\u0131 yerle\u015Ftirirsen
    kazan\u0131rs\u0131n!"
